{"channelId":"UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","row":["Taryn Riel Pediatric Physical Therapy",39,"Hi Everyone! My name is Taryn R. I’ve been a pediatric physical therapist for over 15 years. I have been working with children who need assistance in gaining strength, improving their overall balance, working on their body movements and bilateral coordination. I also work on their motor planning, reaction times, body awareness and safety awareness. I’m certifiied as a pediatric massage therapist and a certified kinesiotaping practitioner.  I incorporate different movements of yoga 🧘🏻‍♂️ to increase flexibility, strength and motor planning.  I add agility drills and body coordination movements as well. \nEach child is different. Each one has strength and the gift to reach their best self.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:08.299Z","channelId":"UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4f3cde88c09e5eb722384138ba9696a51a15836bbee8c7355dff61eaefd80550","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cf5b6ec3d0450cba940f1e6713403c2b707e30b6e2901ad53e76cc8e7f03cb83"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":39,"raw":"39 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:08.299Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist","massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist","massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyCduWMvAkTRLwm1gQY-Gpg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biograp